    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n65936" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελ-ασμός</span></b> , ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>blackening</i> of flesh from
			mortification, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				5.17
			</span></i> (pl.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>dyeing black</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελασμοὶ τριχῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					1.112
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				12.446
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>black spot</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.921f
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				1294.20
			</span></i>; on snakes, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.564d
			</span></i>.</div>
